<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine peso ends higher on dollar inflows.</title>
<headline>Philippine peso ends higher on dollar inflows.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------- Jan 27 -------------------------</p>
<p>*Peso average at 26.333 from 26.341</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The Philippine peso ended up on Monday at 26.337 against the dollar from 26.339 on account of dollar inflows from foreign investors, traders said.</p>
<p>The day's average was at 26.333 from 26.341. Market volume rose to $174.60 million from $126 million.</p>
<p>After hitting a day-high of 26.325, the peso then weakened because of dollar demand from oil companies and other corporations, traders said.</p>
</text>
